✔ 残高シグナル3種の境界とauto-local効果は固定許可リストだけ (6.8034ms)
✔ Genspark前払いクレジットの残り少だけを残高違反にする (0.4001ms)
✔ spend_anomalyは24h降格、gateway overrideは実在確認済みモデルを書く (11.6924ms)
✔ strict percent and date parsing rejects ambiguous or impossible values (0.8245ms)
✔ one untrusted PC does not stop another PC auto action (0.7137ms)
✔ empty fleet is measurement failure (1.9812ms)
✔ 1. When ledger is unreadable (null), measurement_untrusted is reported instead of no_cheap_ai, and no codex actions are decided (1.2312ms)
✔ 2. Stale reports (> 48h) raise stale_report and are excluded from fleet average calculations (0.8543ms)
✔ stale_report 初回は再送指令を送り人へ上げない (0.5986ms)
✔ stale_report 2日目は人へ上げる (0.744ms)
✔ 3. Action is not dispatched if under cooldown (last action within 3 days) (0.4592ms)
✔ 4. Limits auto-codex dispatches to maximum of 2 per run (0.628ms)
✔ 5. Downgrades to human action if same (kind, pc) failed or had no effect 3 consecutive times (0.3765ms)
✔ 6. verifyPreviousActions correctly evaluates pending actions to worked/no_effect/worse based on KPI change (1.0337ms)
✔ 7. Running with --dry-run does not write state files or send notifications (109.8582ms)
✔ 8. auto-local only runs commands that are present in the ALLOWED_LOCAL_COMMANDS whitelist (0.4041ms)
✔ 9. human escalation is neither worked nor shown in the verification section (22.7446ms)
✔ unused_provider is escalated without running a command (0.2291ms)
✔ 10. roster-only rows are excluded without violations and summarized (38.5939ms)
✔ 11. reported rows with missing metrics are untrusted and never displayed as $0.00 (16.28ms)
✔ 11b. empty delegation is untrusted while measured 0.0% is low delegation (0.4643ms)
✔ 12. all known cheap providers participate in unused-provider health checks (0.1996ms)
✔ 13. auto-codex spec contains measured facts and diagnostic guardrails (0.3184ms)
✔ 14. low delegation violations use codex budget for the two lowest ratios (0.5712ms)
✔ 15. human todo messages are Japanese, self-contained, and contain PC name and measured values (1.4162ms)
✔ 16. failed DM notification is saved and prepended to the next report (348.267ms)
✔ 17. 実行ログを1行追記し、フリート取得失敗は NG と理由を残す (288.8733ms)
✔ 18. --dry-run では実行ログを書かない (10.6539ms)
✔ 19. 直近10件の7割以上が no_effect/worse なら報告先頭に警告する (11.5677ms)
✔ 20. heartbeat 失敗でも main は例外を投げずログに notify=failed を残す (257.6644ms)
✔ 21. atomicWrite は rename の一時失敗を再試行して保存する (4.2463ms)
✔ 22. 状態保存が最後まで失敗しても main は成功しログに state=failed を残す (659.6916ms)
✔ 23. buildCombinedCodexSpec は2件の内容を番号付き見出しで区切る (0.5396ms)
✔ 24. buildCombinedCodexSpec は空配列と null に空文字列を返す (0.1087ms)
✔ 25. buildCombinedCodexSpec は1件でも仕様内容を欠落させない (0.1803ms)
✔ 26. provider_unhealthy は failRate 0.20 / http429 50 の境界で発火し codex は除外される (0.5532ms)
✔ 27. codex_saturated / headless_claude は 2回以上 / >0トークン で発火する (0.3392ms)
✔ 28. budget_pace / eval_stale は 100%超 / 7日超または未実行 で発火する (0.3708ms)
